{
 "$schema": "https://schema.tauri.app/capability/2",
 "identifier": "m2rc1-command-surface",
 "description": "The main window may invoke only the 73 commands declared in the application ACL: 66 production commands, four probe commands, and three M2-AC1 acceptance commands. The PLUGIN-RUNTIME-1 local plugin face (list/switch/audit + directory opener) is production-only too. The SETTINGS-OPEN-C-2-BACKUP package face (backup_create/list/restore/delete) is production-only too. P15 settings, the SETTINGS-OPEN-B-2 cleanup trio, and credential commands are production-only; HostControl, P15 credential binding, and opener access remain internal to Rust.",
